<title>USA: Mid-America Apartment sells 2 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Mid-America Apartment sells 2 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS, Tenn. 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mid-America Apartment Communities Inc said on Tuesday it sold 2 million shares of common stock at $28.75 per share.</p>
<p>Mid-America shares were trading at 29 at midday, up 1/4 on the day.</p>
<p>The underwriters for this transaction are Morgan Stanley &amp; Co, Raymond James &amp; Associates, Morgan Keegan &amp; Co Inc and J.C. Bradford &amp; Co.</p>
